  "description": "Superhits is a classic and timeless serif with didot style. This font family have elegant and sophisticated characterized by high contrast between thick vertical and thin horizontal strokes, flat hairline serifs, and a strong geometric structure. Its refined curves and tapered strokes make it ideal for display purposes, particularly in fashion, luxury branding, editorial design, and formal invitations. With eight weight from Thin to Black that you can choose for your project. Superhits also support multi language.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Superhits is a classic and timeless serif with didot style. This font family have elegant and sophisticated characterized by high contrast between thick vertical and thin horizontal strokes, flat hairline serifs, and a strong geometric structure. Its refined curves and tapered strokes make it ideal for display purposes, particularly in fashion, luxury branding, editorial design, and formal invitations. With eight weight from Thin to Black that you can choose for your project. Superhits also support multi language.</p>",
